# R2 engineering working files stay local. Only the files pinned (by SHA-256) in
# garment-spec/ACTIVE_TECHPACK_MASTER.json are tracked: the Production Tech Pack
# generator refuses to run if any of them is missing or changed.
*
!.gitignore
!JACKETEK_ORIGINAL_Patterns_1to1.dxf
!traceability/
traceability/*
!traceability/supplier-package-verification.json
!traceability/factory-master-data.json
!traceability/design-change-CHG-04.json
!traceability/supplier-build/
traceability/supplier-build/*
!traceability/supplier-build/artwork-manifest.json
!traceability/supplier-build/callouts.json
!traceability/supplier-build/confirm-items.json
!traceability/supplier-build/flat-front.png
!traceability/supplier-build/flat-back.png
